  "story": {
    "title": "The Great Tidy Up",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "‘We are going to have so much fun while Gogo is having a nap,’ says big sister Khwezi. ‘Ooh yes!’ says little brother Mzamo. ‘What will we do?’",
      "‘We will clean the house for Papa and Mama while they are out.’ ‘That’s no fun,’ says Mzamo. ‘Uh uh, no. Not me. I don’t want to clean up!’",
      "‘But Papa and Mama will be so proud. Let me show you how much fun we will have!’ says Khwezi.",
      "‘First we will put the toys away!’",
      "‘Now we will sweep the stoep!’",
      "‘Now we will wash the dishes!’",
      "‘Now we will wash the windows!’",
      "‘Now we will polish the floor!’",
      "‘Now we will wash the clothes!’",
      "‘Now we will hang the clothes up!’",
      "“SURPRISE!”",
      "‘I have been watching them the whole time and they have been little angels!’ says Gogo."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "‘We are going to have so much fun while Gogo is having a nap,’ says big sister Khwezi.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng mình sẽ vui lắm khi bà Gogo đang ngủ trưa,"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘Ooh yes!’ says little brother Mzamo.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ồ, vâng ạ!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘What will we do?’",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng mình sẽ làm gì đây?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘We will clean the house for Papa and Mama while they are out.’ ‘That’s no fun,’ says Mzamo.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng mình sẽ dọn nhà cho bố và mẹ khi họ đi vắng. Chẳng vui chút nào,"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘Uh uh, no.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Không không, không đâu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Not me. I don’t want to clean up!’",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Không phải con. Con không muốn dọn dẹp đâu!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘But Papa and Mama will be so proud.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng bố và mẹ sẽ rất tự hào đấy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Let me show you how much fun we will have!’ says Khwezi.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Để chị cho em xem chúng mình sẽ vui thế nào nhé!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘First we will put the toys away!’",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đầu tiên chúng mình sẽ cất đồ chơi đi!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘Now we will sweep the stoep!’",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bây giờ chúng mình sẽ quét hiên nhà!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘Now we will wash the dishes!’",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bây giờ chúng mình sẽ rửa bát đĩa!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘Now we will wash the windows!’",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bây giờ chúng mình sẽ lau cửa sổ!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘Now we will polish the floor!’",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bây giờ chúng mình sẽ đánh bóng sàn nhà!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘Now we will wash the clothes!’",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bây giờ chúng mình sẽ giặt quần áo!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘Now we will hang the clothes up!’",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bây giờ chúng mình sẽ phơi quần áo lên!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“SURPRISE!”",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "BẤT NGỜ!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "‘I have been watching them the whole time and they have been little angels!’ says Gogo.",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_109722/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bà đã theo dõi các cháu suốt thời gian qua và các cháu đúng là những thiên thần nhỏ!"
      }
    ]
  },
